  "about": {
    "sloganSub": "Blockchain Week in Busan 2025",
    "sloganMain": "\"Beyond Connection, Into Nexus\"\n",
    "paragraphs": [
      "**The BWB2025** conference will be a time <br class=\"br-mobile\">to experience firsthand the moment the vision of the <br class=\"br-mobile\">**'Target 2026 blockchain city Busan'** that we have been presenting over the past two years is realized.",
      "@@Web2.0 and Web3.0 linked,@@ <br class=\"br-mobile\">Integrated financial ecosystem <br class=\"br-mobile\">where @@fiat and crypto are freely exchanged@@",
      "A new standard for digital citizenship in which citizens' administration, payment, transportation, and voting are @@integrated into a single wallet@@",
      "A city where personal data is distributed <br class=\"br-mobile\">and encrypted security systems secure all transactions and information through their own control in a blockchain network",
      "**From Busan**,<br class=\"br-mobile\"> innovation begins, spreading to the Global Network and uniting with citizens around the world.\n",
      "@@When everything is combined <br class=\"br-mobile\">with a single Web3.0 wallet, <br class=\"br-mobile\">everyday life around the world begins in your hands.@@",
      "A city where cutting-edge technology becomes the routine of our lives, making your day more convenient, safer and richer.",
      "**We invite you to the moment of great transformation that will open <br class=\"br-mobile\">a new future for everyone.**"
    ],
    "media": {
